IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0042.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY LON0042C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 MI-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 MI-REQUIRED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 WS-RADJ            PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-LTV
    DISPLAY "MI-IND=" MI-IND
    DISPLAY "WS-RADJ=" WS-RADJ
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-LTV.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF LV-PC > 72
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF LV-PC > 90
        SET MI-REQUIRED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0.0050 TO WS-RADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-IND
    END-IF.
